<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net"><diagram name="Payment webhook in plain English" id="PaymentwebhookinplainEnglish"><mxGraphModel dx="1200" dy="900" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="bg" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="26" y="6" width="608" height="664" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="w1" value="&lt;b&gt;1. Priya pays by UPI in her bank app&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#6B7280'&gt;Your app may have been closed by Android by now.&lt;br&gt;That's fine: it is not the one we trust.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1F2933;align=left;spacingLeft=78;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="30" width="560" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="w1ic" value="" style="shape=image;html=1;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;imageAspect=0;aspect=fixed;image=data:image/svg+xml,;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1F2933;labelBackgroundColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="66" y="47" width="46" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="w2" value="&lt;b&gt;2. The gateway sends you a webhook: &quot;paid&quot;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#6B7280'&gt;A message from the payment company to your&lt;br&gt;server. It only waits about 5 seconds for an answer.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1F2933;align=left;spacingLeft=78;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="140" width="560" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="w2ic" value="" style="shape=image;html=1;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;imageAspect=0;aspect=fixed;image=data:image/svg+xml,;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1F2933;labelBackgroundColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="66" y="157" width="46" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="w3" value="&lt;b&gt;3. Save it first, then answer &quot;got it&quot; in 0.1 s&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#6B7280'&gt;Written to Azure SQL before anything slow happens,&lt;br&gt;so a crash can't lose it.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1F2933;align=left;spacingLeft=78;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="250" width="560" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="w3ic" value="" style="shape=image;html=1;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;imageAspect=0;aspect=fixed;image=data:image/svg+xml,;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1F2933;labelBackgroundColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="66" y="267" width="46" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="w4" value="&lt;b&gt;4. A queue does the slow work, with retries&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#6B7280'&gt;Place the order, tell the restaurant, send the push.&lt;br&gt;If a step fails, it simply tries again.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1F2933;align=left;spacingLeft=78;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="360" width="560" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="w4ic" value="" style="shape=image;html=1;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;imageAspect=0;aspect=fixed;image=data:image/svg+xml,;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1F2933;labelBackgroundColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="66" y="377" width="46" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="w5" value="&lt;b&gt;5. Every 5 minutes, a timer asks the gateway&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#6B7280'&gt;&quot;Any paid orders I haven't heard about?&quot;&lt;br&gt;This catches webhooks that never arrived.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1F2933;align=left;spacingLeft=78;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="470" width="560" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="w5ic" value="" style="shape=image;html=1;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;imageAspect=0;aspect=fixed;image=data:image/svg+xml,;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1F2933;labelBackgroundColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="66" y="487" width="46" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="wsum" value="&lt;b&gt;Money taken always ends as an order or a refund.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#6B7280'&gt;Within 5 minutes, whatever happened to the webhook.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontColor=#1F2933;align=left;spacingLeft=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="580" width="560" height="66" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="we0" value="" style="html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#2E5C8A;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1F2933;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;endSize=6;" edge="1" parent="1" source="w1" target="w2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="we1" value="" style="html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#2E5C8A;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1F2933;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;endSize=6;" edge="1" parent="1" source="w2" target="w3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="we2" value="" style="html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#2E5C8A;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1F2933;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;endSize=6;" edge="1" parent="1" source="w3" target="w4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="we3" value="" style="html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#2E5C8A;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1F2933;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;endSize=6;" edge="1" parent="1" source="w4" target="w5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="we4" value="" style="html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#2E5C8A;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1F2933;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;endSize=6;" edge="1" parent="1" source="w5" target="wsum"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>